{{!-- Who is behind the site, on the homepage between the statement and the
     services: the portrait, the client's own introduction, and a way to his
     story. It exists because the rest of the front page is claims - four panels
     and three quotes - and a one-man firm's strongest argument is that the
     person answering the phone is the person doing the work.

     The heading and the text are theme settings, so the client edits them under
     Design; the defaults are his own sentences from the Over page. The portrait
     is a setting too, and falls back to the photograph that travels with the
     theme. That one is 447px, which is why it is drawn at 208: it is a LinkedIn
     profile picture, and asking for the original (or a shoot) is what would let
     it be larger than this. --}}
<section class="band bg-background">
    <div class="page">
        <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-10">
            {{#if @custom.portrait}}
                <img src="{{img_url @custom.portrait size="s" format="webp"}}"
                     srcset="{{img_url @custom.portrait size="xs" format="webp"}} 320w, {{img_url @custom.portrait size="s" format="webp"}} 640w"
                     sizes="208px" width="208" height="208" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                     alt="{{@custom.contact_name}}"
                     class="size-52 shrink-0 rounded-2xl object-cover object-center ring-1 ring-foreground/15">
            {{else}}
                <img src="{{asset "images/andries-447.webp"}}"
                     srcset="{{asset "images/andries-224.webp"}} 224w, {{asset "images/andries-447.webp"}} 447w"
                     sizes="208px" width="208" height="208" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                     alt="{{@custom.contact_name}}"
                     class="size-52 shrink-0 rounded-2xl object-cover object-center ring-1 ring-foreground/15">
            {{/if}}

            <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
                <h2 class="font-heading text-[clamp(1.375rem,2.6vw,1.75rem)] leading-[1.25] font-semibold text-foreground text-balance">
                    {{@custom.intro_heading}}
                </h2>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
                    {{@custom.intro_text}}
                </p>
                {{!-- The one page in this menu that is about him rather than
                      about a service. Ghost nests nothing, so the URL is fixed. --}}
                <p class="mt-6">
                    <a class="inline-flex h-11 items-center font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/35 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary"
                       href="/over/">Lees mijn verhaal</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
